257
00:16:55,940 --> 00:16:57,820
She's light and fast.

258
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,860
She burned a lot of fat.

259
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:04,460
Goodness, it's been ages

260
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,840
since I've seen Mama with moves like that.

261
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:11,537
Give me the wedding cake.

262
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:14,540
It's Big Bob! She's here!

263
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:18,910
Napoleon!

264
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:22,200
Transform into a sword!

265
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:24,040
As you wish!

266
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,440
Mama!

267
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,780
I'm real

268
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:55,460
Not good!

269
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,300
Not good!

270
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:14,320
She got even scarier!

271
00:18:16,020 --> 00:18:18,540
What is this new form?

272
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:23,597
My cake, where is it?

273
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:25,100
Let's see, huh?

274
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,400
Prepare yourselves. Stand back.

275
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:32,240
We might have to abandon ship.

276
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:33,880
No way.

277
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:39,580
I'm so hungry. I'm starving.

278
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:42,560
Only one thing can satisfy me.

279
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,740
I need cake.

280
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,640
Where is it?

281
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:52,974
Where the hell is my damn wedding cake?

282
00:18:56,580 --> 00:19:00,680
I don't suppose we
could ask her to vacate?

283
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:10,920
That startled me!

284
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:33,330
Careful!

285
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:37,977
If he keeps this up, we won't have a
single mirror left in the whole Tang town.

286
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:41,531
Who knew he could stand up to
General Katakuri for so long?

287
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:48,024
We keep getting reports of mirrors
breaking from across Tutuland.

288
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:51,377
Sacrebleu is already half past Nif.

289
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,989
It's been almost 12 hours since
the attack on the tea party.

290
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:57,540
I would appreciate some kind of update.

291
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:02,006
Attention, please, gentlemen.

292
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,689
I might have some
interesting info for you.

293
00:20:04,860 --> 00:20:05,920
Don't spoil it.

294
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:09,100
You're ruining the Straw
Hat's chances of survival.

295
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:11,520
Go ahead, Mademoiselle Stussy.

296
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:16,920
Do you recall how Linlin was
flaunting the Tamate Box,

297
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:19,219
the treasure from the Ryugu Palace?

298
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:25,000
Tell me, is it true that Straw
Hat Luffy gifted it to her?

299
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:28,100
And why do you mention this, sir?

300
00:20:28,300 --> 00:20:30,124
You want to hear a funny story?

301
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:33,340
That box was the cause of the blast.

302
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:36,840
Now you are just being absurd!

303
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:41,400
Oh, just look at him!

304
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:42,780
He's so cool!

305
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:46,680
You kick his butt good, big bro!

306
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:49,573
Hey, what's the holdup?

307
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,760
Is there a problem? I don't know.

308
00:20:52,100 --> 00:20:55,677
Maybe I'm just doing my damnedest
not to get noticed by him, okay?

309
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,737
The little creep won't hold still, though.

310
00:20:57,820 --> 00:20:58,920
He's so fast.

311
00:20:59,940 --> 00:21:00,770
Damn.

312
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,230
Lame excuse.

313
00:21:02,313 --> 00:21:03,143
Give me a fuck.

314
00:21:07,040 --> 00:21:09,981
You know that Big Bro
Kadakuri's got this and all.

315
00:21:10,260 --> 00:21:12,613
Sure wish we could help him in some way.

316
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:18,220
Hey, you guys, do you know who's gonna
get some head pats from Big Brew? Huh?

317
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:19,390
Tell me!

318
00:21:19,473 --> 00:21:20,303
Isn't it obvious?

319
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:22,500
It's you, Lady Floppe!

320
00:21:22,860 --> 00:21:24,160
Good answer!

321
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:33,440
I have a total of 41 older brothers.

322
00:21:33,700 --> 00:21:36,357
During the Best Little
Sister Awards ceremony,

323
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:39,160
a whopping 40 of them voted for Sweet Omi!

324
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,360
I won!

325
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,500
You won't love me!

326
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:47,880
Thank you!

327
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:50,592
It's an honor to be everybody's favorite!

328
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:54,193
I'm gonna be king of the Little Sisters!

329
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,990
Adorable!

330
00:21:59,520 --> 00:22:03,157
Everyone is dying to get some
attention from my beloved big brother!

331
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,677
I can't really blame them, though.

332
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:05,617
Just look at him!

333
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:09,357
Even all my other siblings, brothers
included, won a piece of him.

334
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:12,497
Honestly, I have far too many
rivals for his affection.

335
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:14,180
It's hardly even fair.

336
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:19,257
If I can somehow figure out a way to help
him, I'll score some points for sure.

337
00:22:19,340 --> 00:22:21,600
I feel that on an emotional level.

338
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:25,537
We would love to get into General
Katakuri's good graces as well.

339
00:22:25,620 --> 00:22:28,326
You heard me, I called
dibs, get lost already.

340
00:22:29,580 --> 00:22:31,717
I knew there was trouble when he got here.

341
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:33,660
He didn't seem like himself.

342
00:22:35,700 --> 00:22:38,440
But now he's back to maximum coolness!

343
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:40,330
Hmm,

344
00:22:40,520 --> 00:22:45,285
despite that, I really do despise to see
him struggle this much against an enemy.

345
00:22:47,580 --> 00:22:53,260
He must embody total perfection at
all times, or it'll disappoint me!

346
00:22:55,140 --> 00:22:56,280
True, true.

347
00:22:57,040 --> 00:22:58,320
I don't know, though.

348
00:22:58,840 --> 00:23:01,075
Maybe struggle is too harsh of a word.

349
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:03,297
This other guy's really
hanging in there is all.

350
00:23:03,380 --> 00:23:06,340
Every time General Katakuri
knocks him on his ass,

351
00:23:06,540 --> 00:23:08,716
he gets back up for a second helping.

352
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:19,221
Luffable indeed.

353
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:38,360
Where are you hiding my wedding cake?

354
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:43,340
Let's see if you rotten
brats put it under here.

355
00:23:43,540 --> 00:23:45,500
We do not have what you seek.

356
00:23:47,580 --> 00:23:48,410
Liar.

357
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:52,340
It has to be here.

358
00:23:53,420 --> 00:23:54,660
Believe in our word.

359
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:57,607
You shall not find any
cake aboard this ship.

360
00:23:58,800 --> 00:24:00,140
So you say.

361
00:24:01,040 --> 00:24:02,740
It's around here somewhere.

362
00:24:03,380 --> 00:24:05,720
You're just hiding it from me! Ooh.

363
00:24:06,700 --> 00:24:08,897
My eldest son told me that it's here,

364
00:24:08,980 --> 00:24:13,197
and he surely knows better than to lie to
his dear old mother, because if he did,

365
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:15,560
I'd murder him with my own two hands.

366
00:24:18,380 --> 00:24:21,200
I was hoping she wouldn't remember.

367
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:25,960
If you are lying, you'll pay.

368
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:30,040
Don't think I won't
take your lifespan, boy.

369
00:24:32,140 --> 00:24:34,920
She's actually aware of what's going on?

370
00:24:35,120 --> 00:24:37,460
I thought she was lost in a daze!

371
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:42,440
I was sure that I could lickety-trick her!

372
00:24:45,420 --> 00:24:49,760
You've got some nerve accusing my
son of being a dirty, rotten liar!

373
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,660
Hey, Napoleon!

374
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:54,021
What's up, Mama?

375
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,070
Cognac!

376
00:25:01,080 --> 00:25:02,240
You ready?

377
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:05,460
I'll slice you into
two and set you ablaze!

378
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:07,000
Flaming sword!

379
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:09,060
Get away from her, Jinbei!

380
00:25:09,600 --> 00:25:10,430
Die!

381
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:15,620
Corgi, glaze! Mama!

382
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,420
The hell's going on?

383
00:25:28,580 --> 00:25:30,860
Is she blocking a swing from Cognac?

384
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:40,760
I almost feel sorry for you, Shark.

385
00:25:42,520 --> 00:25:44,780
You're overestimating your power!

386
00:25:51,580 --> 00:25:55,120
Oh no, Team Bay! Is he okay? Team Bay!

387
00:25:56,180 --> 00:25:57,760
Ma-ma-ma-ma!

388
00:26:04,220 --> 00:26:06,700
I'm withering away over here!

389
00:26:07,100 --> 00:26:08,100
Where's the cake?

390
00:26:08,300 --> 00:26:09,477
Give it to me already!

391
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:11,180
Kara, no!

392
00:26:12,420 --> 00:26:14,100
Stop it! Stay away!

393
00:26:16,180 --> 00:26:18,220
Leave that room alone!

394
00:26:19,020 --> 00:26:21,540
I'll stop on one condition.

395
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:24,940
Fork over my cage!

396
00:26:32,220 --> 00:26:33,180
Nani!

397
00:26:33,740 --> 00:26:35,000
I'm okay.

398
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:40,460
Oh, no!

399
00:26:40,660 --> 00:26:42,737
The sail caught fire from Big Mom's hair!

400
00:26:42,820 --> 00:26:44,291
Our dear ship is burning!

401
00:26:46,300 --> 00:26:49,900
Just mess up already! Run, Nami!

402
00:26:50,660 --> 00:26:53,820
I want my cake!

403
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,760
Guard Point!

404
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,790
Chopper!

405
00:27:08,840 --> 00:27:11,197
Take a look at you little guy!

406
00:27:11,280 --> 00:27:13,577
You're even stranger than I thought.

407
00:27:13,660 --> 00:27:17,937
I can't wait to add you to my
collection of rare creatures.

408
00:27:18,020 --> 00:27:21,297
You must be the plumpest
little raccoon I ever saw.

409
00:27:21,380 --> 00:27:23,557
I'm not a stinking raccoon.

410
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:25,660
I'm a reindeer, damn it!

411
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:33,157
After I get my wedding cake, I'll find a
special place for both you and Soul King.

412
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,620
Let go of me!

413
00:27:34,780 --> 00:27:38,177
We don't have your dumb cake,
and I'm not your play thing!

414
00:27:38,260 --> 00:27:39,090
Duffer!

415
00:27:40,800 --> 00:27:44,900
Oh, if the ship sinks, maybe my
lickety-ly will go down with it.

416
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,471
That's what I call lucky.

417
00:27:46,560 --> 00:27:48,557
You know, if that thing goes up in smoke,

418
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:51,758
our annoying vermin problem
will take care of itself.

419
00:27:52,420 --> 00:27:53,780
Oh, no!

420
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:56,260
The ship! The ship!

421
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:57,900
It's burning up!

422
00:28:15,340 --> 00:28:16,720
Come, come, come!

423
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:32,040
Did he attempt to dodge?

424
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,180
Why aren't you knocked out?

425
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:45,645
Why do you still have
that glimmer in your eye?

426
00:29:18,300 --> 00:29:23,180
Falling is shameful enough in itself, but
you keep getting back up to do it again.

427
00:29:49,760 --> 00:29:54,460
Oh no, a ship, a ship, it's burning up!

428
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:02,647
Now, are you gonna mess up and tell me
where the wedding cake is hidden or not?

429
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:05,220
Let me go! Chumper!

430
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:06,620
Oh, no, no, no!

431
00:30:06,820 --> 00:30:08,077
We have to put out the fire!

432
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:08,990
Where do we go?

433
00:30:09,073 --> 00:30:09,903
Water! Water!

434
00:30:09,986 --> 00:30:10,816
We need water!

435
00:30:15,540 --> 00:30:16,370
Ocean current!

436
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:21,350
Soldier throw!

437
00:30:32,580 --> 00:30:33,410
Help me!

438
00:30:42,460 --> 00:30:43,500
Oh!

439
00:30:47,420 --> 00:30:48,460
Ah!

440
00:30:57,580 --> 00:30:58,840
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

441
00:30:59,420 --> 00:31:00,597
Damn that guy!

442
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:02,680
Oh, that water really drenched me.

443
00:31:08,260 --> 00:31:09,090
Jimmy!

444
00:31:12,440 --> 00:31:13,270
Mama!

445
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:16,020
This is your final warning.

446
00:31:16,380 --> 00:31:18,439
Now remove yourself from this ship!

447
00:31:19,280 --> 00:31:21,040
Is that all you want?

448
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:26,097
Give me back the cake
and I'll be on my way!

449
00:31:26,180 --> 00:31:30,640
Fish and Karate secret out!

450
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,820
Magamon Drill!

451
00:32:01,500 --> 00:32:02,330
Mama!

452
00:32:05,660 --> 00:32:07,280
There's no way!

453
00:32:08,400 --> 00:32:09,620
All right!

454
00:32:09,740 --> 00:32:11,328
He kicked her off the city!

455
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:13,860
Good job!

456
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,500
Nice way!

457
00:32:15,780 --> 00:32:17,340
Way to go!

458
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:19,080
Don't rejoice yet!

459
00:32:20,060 --> 00:32:21,957
Your captain entrusted the ship to us,

460
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:25,137
so we must ensure it's still
standing when he returns!

461
00:32:25,220 --> 00:32:27,808
We cannot allow our
guard to rest so easily.

462
00:32:27,900 --> 00:32:31,897
Remember, if Perospero catches up to
us, then it will truly be the end.

463
00:32:31,980 --> 00:32:33,098
Yeah, you're right.

464
00:32:33,340 --> 00:32:34,399
A very good point.

465
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:37,360
We must forge ahead.

466
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:42,014
It's only a matter of time before Big
Mom will be on her feet once again.

467
00:32:45,560 --> 00:32:47,380
How's Karen? She's fine.

468
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:51,522
Let's make some distance
between us and our foes.

469
00:32:56,060 --> 00:32:58,020
Are you holding up okay, Mama?

470
00:32:58,620 --> 00:32:59,450
Yeah.

471
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:02,920
Mama, Mama.

472
00:33:03,580 --> 00:33:05,720
Not bad, Jinbe.

473
00:33:07,820 --> 00:33:09,140
I warned you.

474
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:12,520
Ah, that gives me a good idea.

475
00:33:16,180 --> 00:33:17,920
I'll slice their ship.

476
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,520
Sounds good to me.

477
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:23,120
It should be easier to
find my cake that way.

478
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,880
It will be mine!

479
00:33:28,460 --> 00:33:29,837
Her sword is stretching!

480
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,917
What if she starts swinging it around?

481
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:34,397
Then I fear that our
ship will be done for.

482
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:37,417
We're in a much better position
with her off the ship, though.

483
00:33:37,500 --> 00:33:38,860
Come here, Susie!

484
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:42,626
Do you want some more treats?

485
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:45,000
Ready, please?

486
00:33:45,740 --> 00:33:46,680
Black ball!

487
00:33:56,620 --> 00:33:58,300
Oh boy, oh boy!

488
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:00,480
You like that?

489
00:34:00,740 --> 00:34:02,620
Here, all for you!

490
00:34:02,840 --> 00:34:04,600
Are they really? Wow!

491
00:34:05,320 --> 00:34:07,880
Wait a sec, I know that
you're tricking me!

492
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:15,380
I won't be falling for that one
again, foul tempestors of evil!

493
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,160
Tommy, no!

494
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:22,950
Huh?

495
00:34:23,033 --> 00:34:23,863
That was me.

496
00:34:24,560 --> 00:34:25,540
You jerk!

497
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:33,260
Are you shot?

498
00:34:33,460 --> 00:34:36,872
Since I lack flesh and guts,
your lightning has no effect.

499
00:34:37,740 --> 00:34:39,500
Is that so?

500
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,920
Sure you want to fight me?

501
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:43,440
Soul King!

502
00:34:44,020 --> 00:34:44,850
My,

503
00:34:44,933 --> 00:34:49,720
how quickly you forget that your sword
failed to even lay a single scratch on me!

504
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:51,020
I recall.

505
00:34:52,120 --> 00:34:55,737
But might I suggest
that you give me a brief

506
00:34:55,820 --> 00:34:58,820
glimpse of what an Emperor's
Paris might look like!

507
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:15,680
Daddy.

508
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:18,220
That should do it.

509
00:35:19,740 --> 00:35:21,840
Never, you mind, it's over.

510
00:35:22,660 --> 00:35:24,880
Now, three verse humming.

511
00:35:26,700 --> 00:35:28,160
Soul nut slash.

512
00:35:31,680 --> 00:35:34,477
Our only target was Zeus this whole time.

513
00:35:34,560 --> 00:35:36,600
Misdirection at its finest.

514
00:35:38,380 --> 00:35:40,137
Dammit, cut off guard.

515
00:35:40,220 --> 00:35:42,200
Pull it together, Zeus.

516
00:35:46,260 --> 00:35:48,680
Positive charge, black ball, go!

517
00:35:49,220 --> 00:35:51,700
Now discharge and you'll feel way better.

518
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:54,420
Little Zeusy-Foo. Monster!

519
00:35:56,680 --> 00:35:58,440
How could you?

520
00:36:01,700 --> 00:36:03,160
What is this?

521
00:36:17,660 --> 00:36:18,490
No!

522
00:36:19,300 --> 00:36:21,500
What did they just pull off?

523
00:36:21,660 --> 00:36:23,020
They just slotted Zeus!

524
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:27,550
Mama!

525
00:36:29,220 --> 00:36:30,820
It really worked!

526
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:32,826
That'll buy us a little time.

527
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:35,777
We should take this opportunity
to make some headway.

528
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:38,240
Hurry along, Brooke! Very well.

529
00:36:42,200 --> 00:36:43,030
Whoa!

530
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:46,710
Whoa!

531
00:36:48,020 --> 00:36:50,040
Tell me how much you all miss me!

532
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:51,790
Yay!

533
00:36:51,873 --> 00:36:53,620
Welcome back! Nicely done! Huh?

534
00:36:55,420 --> 00:36:58,480
We tried to minimize the
damage as best we could,

535
00:36:58,720 --> 00:37:01,249
but the sunny still
took quite the beating.

536
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,357
That reminds me.

537
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:06,340
I found this on my way back.

538
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:09,540
Oh, Pussy Poo!

539
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,177
Isn't that guy dangerous?

540
00:37:11,260 --> 00:37:14,320
I highly doubt he'll
cause us any more trouble.

541
00:37:14,640 --> 00:37:16,440
Oh, what a doozy.

542
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,540
Where am I?

543
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:22,580
Welcome back, little buddy.

544
00:37:24,660 --> 00:37:26,500
Thanks, I guess.

545
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:33,020
So, Zuzy-poo, I've been
meaning to ask you.

546
00:37:33,860 --> 00:37:37,389
Why in the world did you try
to electrocute me earlier, huh?

547
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,590
Sorry.

548
00:37:39,673 --> 00:37:41,120
If sorry fixed everything,

549
00:37:41,460 --> 00:37:44,872
all of those marines out there
would be out of a job, huh?

550
00:37:48,460 --> 00:37:51,377
There must have been a
misconception along the way.

551
00:37:51,460 --> 00:37:52,872
How about I rephrase it?

552
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:57,640
I wasn't asking to be friends,
just so we're on the same page. No.

553
00:37:57,980 --> 00:37:59,980
I'll state the question once more.

554
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,480
Will you be my servant?

555
00:38:04,700 --> 00:38:06,560
Or will you die?

556
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:11,184
Think it over carefully, cutie.

557
00:38:14,860 --> 00:38:15,840
Mama, look!

558
00:38:16,380 --> 00:38:17,400
Mama, look!

559
00:38:20,640 --> 00:38:23,080
Shut your mouth! Mama!

560
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:27,750
Prometheus!

561
00:38:27,833 --> 00:38:28,777
Let's go after them!

562
00:38:28,860 --> 00:38:29,960
I'm on it, Mama!
